              "excerptSha256": "8ee9a7c2b49da66691db93a7e252521126376ae04c092a2e5b5deb751192e4c8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-mov-examples",
        "moduleId": "instruction-and-operands",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "补充：两个对照的 `mov` 写法",
        "markdown": "```armasm\nmov    w0, #0      ; 立即数 0 写入 w0\nmov    w1, w0      ; 把 w0 的值复制到 w1\n```\n\n第一个例子的源操作数是写在指令里的常数，第二个例子的源操作数是寄存器，复制的是执行到这一行时 `w0` 里的值。两行的目的操作数都写在前面，写反顺序就会改变含义。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-mov-instruction"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-w0-register",
        "moduleId": "instruction-and-operands",
